{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29024","headline":"题舒女庙 · 许浑","name":"题舒女庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山乐来迎去不言，庙前高柳水禽喧。\n绮罗无色雨侵帐，珠翠有声风绕幡。\n妆镜尚疑山月满，寝屏犹认野花繁。\n孤舟梦断行云散，何限离心寄晓猨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}